      *################################################################*00010015
      *                                                                 00020003
      * FD/Trade Finance                                                00030003
      *                                                                 00040003
      * Lists charges. The amounts/percentages presented have been      00040003
      * computed from occurences on TF_Main_Charge and TF_Part_Charge   00040003
      * in accordance with the "Method_Of_Calculation" pertaining to    00040003
      * each particular charge type.                                    00040003
      *                                                                 00060003
      * As "-In-Action", use "-In-Add" if you need figures for          00060003
      * presentation to the end user or for settlement.                 00060003
      *                                                                 00060003
      * Use "-In-Subtract" if you need to modify input figures from the 00060003
      * end user in connection with updates of TF_Main_Charge and/or    00060003
      * TF_Part_Charge.                                                 00060003
      *
      * NB! This module does not present the figures as they appear from
      * any of the two database tables. If you need figures that have
      * NOT been modified, use module F115L060!
      *                                                                 00060003
      *################################################################*00070015
      *                                                                 00080003
           03  R115L070-Comp-Charge.                                    00090003
      *                                                                 00100003
             05  R115L070-Version-No                Pic  X(08).         00110003
               88  R115L070-Version                    Value '19990628'.00120053
      *                                                                 00130003
             05  R115L070-Qualification.                                00140003
      *                                                                 00140118
               10  R115L070-In-Action               Pic  X(16).
                 88  R115L070-In-Add                   Value 'ADD'.
                 88  R115L070-In-Subtract              Value 'SUBTRACT'.
      *
               10  R115L070-In-Key.                                     00140218
      *                                                                 00140318
                 15  R115L070-In-Table-Version      Pic  X(16).         00140418
                   88  R115L070-In-Actual                Value 'ACTUAL'.00140518
                   88  R115L070-In-Work                  Value 'WORK'.  00140618
      *
      * Optional.
                 15  R115L070-In-Read.
                   19  R115L070-In-Read-From        Pic S9(04)   Comp.
                   19  R115L070-In-Read-To          Pic S9(04)   Comp.
      *                                                                 00140733
      * Fin-Inst-No is mandatory.                                       00141333
                 15  R115L070-In-Fin-Inst.                              00141433
                   20  R115L070-In-Fin-Inst-No      Pic  X(18).         00141533
                   20  R115L070-In-Fin-Inst-ID      Pic S9(18).         00141633
                 15  R115L070-In-Reg-No             Pic  9(04).
      *                                                                 00142103
      * Use both.                                                       00142203
                 15  R115L070-In-Contract.                              00142318
                   20  R115L070-In-Contract-Type    Pic  X(03).         00142418
                   20  R115L070-In-Contract-No      Pic S9(07)   Comp-3.00143018
      *                                                                 00143103
      * May be zero.                                                    00143203
                 15  R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No          Pic S9(04)   Comp.  00144018
      *                                                                 00145006
                 15  R115L070-In-Operation-Type     Pic  X(20).         00146018
      *                                                                 00150003
